{"id": 14538, "title": "My new home", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "my-new-home", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/14538_my-new-home.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["去年我和家人买了一套新房子，今年我们搬进来了。新家西边有一条干净的河，南边有一个森林公园。周围有山，有水，有树，有花，风景非常漂亮，空气也非常新鲜。每天早上都能看到很多人去公园运动，晚上河边也有很多人散步。新家的东边有一个小学，孩子们每天准时上课，下课以后就去公园玩，感觉很快乐。我的孩子就在这个学校学习，因为离家很近，他每天中午都能回家吃饭。我太喜欢我的新家了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["去年我和家人買了一套新房子，今年我們搬進來了。新家西邊有一條乾淨的河，南邊有一個森林公園。周圍有山，有水，有樹，有花，風景非常漂亮，空氣也非常新鮮。每天早上都能看到很多人去公園運動，晚上河邊也有很多人散步。新家的東邊有一個小學，孩子們每天準時上課，下課以後就去公園玩，感覺很快樂。我的孩子就在這個學校學習，因為離家很近，他每天中午都能回家吃飯。我太喜歡我的新家了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["qù nián wǒ hé jiā rén mǎi le yī tào xīn fáng zi， jīn nián wǒ men bān jìn lái le。 xīn jiā xī bian yǒu yī tiáo gān jìng de hé， nán bian yǒu yī gè sēn lín gōng yuán。 zhōu wéi yǒu shān， yǒu shuǐ， yǒu shù， yǒu huā， fēng jǐng fēi cháng piào liang， kōng qì yě fēi cháng xīn xiān。 měi tiān zǎo shang dōu néng kàn dào hěn duō rén qù gōng yuán yùn dòng， wǎn shang hé bian yě yǒu hěn duō rén sàn bù。 xīn jiā de dōng bian yǒu yī gè xiǎo xué， hái zi men měi tiān zhǔn shí shàng kè， xià kè yǐ hòu jiù qù gōng yuán wán， gǎn jué hěn kuài lè。 wǒ de hái zi jiù zài zhè gè xué xiào xué xí， yīn wèi lí jiā hěn jìn， tā měi tiān zhōng wǔ dōu néng huí jiā chī fàn。 wǒ tài xǐ huan wǒ de xīn jiā le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["My family and I bought a new house last year and we moved in this year. There is a clean river to the west of the new home and a forest park to the south. There are mountains, water, trees, and flowers around. The scenery is very beautiful and the air is very fresh. Every morning you can see many people going to the park to exercise, and there are also many people walking along the river in the evening. There is a primary school to the east of the new home. The children go to class on time every day and go to the park to play after class. They feel very happy. My child studies in this school. Because it is very close to home, he can go home for lunch every day. I love my new home so much."], "english_full": "My family and I bought a new house last year and we moved in this year. There is a clean river to the west of the new home and a forest park to the south. There are mountains, water, trees, and flowers around. The scenery is very beautiful and the air is very fresh. Every morning you can see many people going to the park to exercise, and there are also many people walking along the river in the evening. There is a primary school to the east of the new home. The children go to class on time every day and go to the park to play after class. They feel very happy. My child studies in this school. Because it is very close to home, he can go home for lunch every day. I love my new home so much.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qù nián\" data-defn=\"last year\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">去年</span><span class=\"tr\">去年</span><rt>qù nián</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hé\" data-defn=\"and; together with\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā rén\" data-defn=\"family member\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家人</span><span class=\"tr\">家人</span><rt>jiā rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mǎi\" data-defn=\"to buy / to purchase\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby cl